Package: tidytargets
Title: Tidy Pipe-Friendly Grammar for R Targets Pipelines
Version: 0.2.1
Authors@R: c(
    person("Stefano", "Mangiola", email = "mangiolastefano@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Jiayi", "Si", email = "si.j@wehi.edu.au",
           role = "aut"),
    person("Mengyuan", "Shen", email = "shen.m@wehi.edu.au",
           role = "aut")
    )
Description: A tidy, pipe-friendly grammar for composing targets pipelines.
    Internally it is based on targets factories, translating piped steps into
    a dependency graph that can be deployed locally, on HPC, or in the cloud.
License: GPL-2
